<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Ventis tradere. (<hi rendition="#i">Horaz.</hi>) (<hi rendition="#i">Tappius, 130<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Binder II, 3336; Philippi, II, 243.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*366 Guten Wind haben.</hi></p>                <lb/>
