<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*369 He makt Wind as Eve.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Ostfr.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, VI, 281, 670; Eichwald, 2072.</hi></p>                <lb/>
