<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Böhm.</hi>: Co draho, to mílo; co lacino, to hnilo. &#x2013; Láce za láci, peníze darmo. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 331.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Slov.</hi>: &#x010C;o je vzácné, nenie lacné. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 331.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">10 Was man wolfeil lobt, das kan man nicht tewer geben.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Petri, II, 605.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">11 Was wohlfeil ist, das achtet man nicht.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Magis illa juvant, quae plurimis emuntur. (<hi rendition="#i">Juvenal.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">12 Was wohlfeil ist, ist theuer.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Blass, 22.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">13 Wer wohlfeil gibt, dem hilft St. Nikolaus verkaufen.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Graf, 252, 160.</hi></p>                <lb/>
