<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Böhm.</hi>: Kdo se domluvy (slova) nebojí, nebojí se ani holi. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovsky, 409.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Si cui mens est tam illiberalis, ut objurgatione non corrigitur, is etiam ad plagas durabitur. (<hi rendition="#i">Seybold, 558.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
