<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Fasces sunt fasces. (<hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 314 u. 1771; Eiselein, 625; Seybold, 173; Philippi, I, 151; Binder I, 520; II, 1099; Schonheim, F, 4.</hi>) &#x2013; Fructus honos oneris, fructus honoris onus. (<hi rendition="#i">Seybold, 195.</hi>) &#x2013; Honoris onera. (<hi rendition="#i">Seybold, 222.</hi>) &#x2013; Honos et onos. (<hi rendition="#i">Seybold, 415.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
