<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*148 Enem af den Zând fälen.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Siebenbürg.-sächs.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 325, 257.</hi></p>                <lb/>
