<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">3 De ahne Tom will ridn, liggt fakn in'n Sanne.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Eichwald, 1943.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">4 Den kost de Tûm ôk mehr as dat Pêrd, segt Licke.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Hildesheim.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Hoefer, 668.</hi></p>                <lb/>
