<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Eripere telum, non dare irato, docet. (<hi rendition="#i">Franck, I, 68<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Philippi, I, 134; Gaal, 1803.</hi>) &#x2013; Ne serum igni. (<hi rendition="#i">Sailer, Sprüche, 115, 75.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
