<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">54 Am Aba nit nid'r, am Morga nid ûf, isch all'r fule Lüüte Bruch.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Bern.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Zyro, 56.</hi></p>                <lb/>
