<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*20 Dâu is alles âfgange, wêi aff der Matthes'n Hâuchzet.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Nürnberg.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, VI, 4156.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*21 Davon geht wol noch was ab.</hi></p>                <lb/>
