<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*29 Hei géid af, as wenne Leär (Leder) fréäten hädde.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Iserlohn.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 57, 2.</hi></p>                <lb/>
