<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*81 Mer dörf 'n nît krumm ousag'n.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Franken.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, VI, 319, 241.</hi></p>                <lb/>
