<p rendition="#et2">10 <hi rendition="#i">Böhm.</hi>: Chvastej se, chvastje', ajhle shnilá jablka, hle kobylince nad vodou plynou. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovský, 103.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
