<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">49 Die weltlich Art &#x2013; Gottes widerpart.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Keil, 20.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">50 E n' Ard hed e n' Ard.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Tobler, 26.</hi></p>                <lb/>
