<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">3 Wenn 't Aschermidwoch regent, verdrögt de Nett'l hinern Tûn.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Altmark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Danneil, 261.</hi></p>                <lb/>
