</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head>Zu Atz.</head>                <p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Span.</hi>: Si al palomar no le falta cebo no le faltaran palomas. (<hi rendition="#i">Don Quixote.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Attila.</hi></head>                <lb/>
