<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Attila, flagellum Dei &#x2013; I Francesi suor frati (fratelli). (<hi rendition="#i">Giani, 713.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Aetz.</hi></head>                <lb/>
