*27 He hett 't upt<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>, is 'n richtig Testament.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Ostpr.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 522, 544.</hi></p>                <lb/>
