<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*29 Hi as ap, iar a Düwel Skur um hoa.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Nordfries.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Johannsen, 74.</hi></p>                <lb/>
