<p rendition="#et2">175 <hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Nihil differt a Chaerephonte. (<hi rendition="#i">Aristophanes.</hi>) (<hi rendition="#i">Erasm., 486; Philippi, II, 22.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
