<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Arbor honoretur, cujus nos umbra tuetur. (<hi rendition="#i">Altdorf, 254; Binder II, 219; Seybold, 34.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
