</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Beichte.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2">2 <hi rendition="#i">Holl.</hi>: Men en sal gheen biecht melden. (<hi rendition="#i">Tunn., 19, 14.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Semper celanda confessio neo reservanda. (<hi rendition="#i">Fallersleben, 537.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
