<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*17 Er b'schysst d' Lüt, 'ass eim d' Auge-n-überlaufe.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Solothurn.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schild, 72, 176.</hi></p>                <lb/>
