<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">12 Best in't Midden, sä Düwel, de gung he tüsken twâ kapen.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Bueren, 77; Hauskalender, III.</hi></p>                <lb/>
