</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Bettel.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2">1 <hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Mendicus ubique habet saccum paratum. (<hi rendition="#i">Binder II, 1838; Lehmann, 46, 48</hi>.)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2">3 <hi rendition="#i">Schwed.</hi>: Fatighman höghburin aer laghir i hedher. (<hi rendition="#i">Reuterdahl, 378.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
