<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: E caula ad aulem. (<hi rendition="#i">Binder II, 892; Schreger, 7.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Bettelmantel.</hi></head>                <lb/>
