<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*51 Wo blîw öck nu, eh 't düster wat.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier, I, 382.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Bleich.</hi></head>                <lb/>
