<pb facs="#f0527" n="[515]"/>
<cb n="1029"/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*59 Er macht z'erst Bode, gäb (bevor) er trinkt.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Solothurn.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Schild, 71, 169.</hi></p>                <lb/>
