<p rendition="#et">19 &#x201E;Iclich mot dragen sine egene borden unde rede geven vor sinen orden.&#x201C; (<hi rendition="#i">Lübben, Reineke de Vos, 4079.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">21 Bei Tunnicius (683): Lichte burden wêrden swâr. (Paenula fit plumbum, longe si corpore fertur.)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: Light burdens far heavy.</p>                <lb/>
