</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Donnerknall.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">Der Donnerknall kompt schnell zu uns, bezahl, was du schuldig bist.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Lehmann, 709, 8.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Donnerkröte.</hi></head>                <lb/>
