<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*5 Man ömmer droplos wie op Stêfkinder.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Tilsit.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier, I, 604.</hi></p>                <lb/>
