<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*27 Dä gönnt net un mag ah selvs net.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Bedburg.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Gonte.</hi></head>                <lb/>
