</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Kapzen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* A verschater Kapzen<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi>.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Jüd.-deutsch. Warschau.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
