</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Kippen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*2 Er kippt.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Köthen.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
