</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Lork.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*3 Dar hot 'n Lork an 'n Strick.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oberharz.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">Er hat was Schlimmes, auch in anderem Sinne: er hat was Tüchtiges erreicht.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*4 Do leit dr Lork.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oberharz.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*5 En' zaketer Lork.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oberharz.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">Ein zackiger Lork, ein hitziger schlimmer Mensch.</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Los</hi> (Subst.).</head>                <lb/>
