</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Scheffelbüxe.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* Hei heft e Schepelböxe on e Metzkenarsch.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier, I, 518.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Scheffelfuss.</hi></head>                <lb/>
