</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Scherz.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">53 Langer Scherz thut niemals gut.</hi></p>                <lb/>
