<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Soglia e Barbone non perdon mai stagione. (<hi rendition="#i">Giani 199.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Sollen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">9 Wir solten wol (deberemus quidem), sagte jene Nonne, da der Bischof fragte, ob sie alle keusch weren.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Herberger, I<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>, 227.</hi></p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Solus.</hi></head>                <lb/>
